  "text": "The AMF Q&A explains the notion of the investment service of investment advice (MiFID II): a personal recommendation to a client, on request or at the firm's initiative, concerning transactions in financial instruments. Whether a service amounts to advice depends on whether the recommendation is presented as suitable for, or based on the situation of, the client (summary of the cited page).",
